  "notes": "Small open-source-style ChatGPT voice wrapper. Signature touches: blue-violet-to-pink gradient applied to the waveform logo, the 'SpeechGPT' wordmark, round user avatars (purple-pink) and assistant avatars (yellow-green), and the Send (violet) / Record (red-orange) buttons. Sidebar conversations use pastel colored dots per topic and amber stars for favorites, separated by a hairline divider; each row has a grey count pill and a hover-revealed ⋮ row menu. Message rows reveal speak/delete/copy icon buttons on hover. Composer toolbar has mic, speaker (TTS), reset and clear icons. Overflow ⋮ menu top-right holds Setting/Feedback/About. Chat is a bordered box rather than free-floating bubbles; no bubble backgrounds."
